  "releaseNotes": "Ported ShowMembers(IEnumerable<Beam> beams), HideMember(Beam beam) and HideMembers(IEnumerable<Beam> beams) with complete interface and adapter XML IntelliSense. Captured positive analytical IDs once, preserved collection order and duplicates, and reused caller-thread View dispatch with explicit unacknowledged void-completion receipts. View covers 21 of 70 source overloads and 21 of 67 reviewed native names. Full release notes: https://github.com/StruXllence/StaadPro.Interop/blob/main/docs/Release-Notes.md",
